{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在上半屏左侧的大号白字和紫色强调词“那些气不该忍”，随后视线容易被下方同样醒目的蓝色词“没了力气”“只觉得难受”吸引。上下两块大字都具有较强视觉权重。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人仍对过去受的气感到不服，似乎还在与自己较劲；具体当下处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、难受，带有疲惫感。\",\n  \"missed\": \"反复与自己较劲如何耗尽力气、不服气如何逐渐消退，以及如今已经不在那些人身边这一背景。几层意思需要读完整下方长句才能建立联系。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大号文字都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分布在上下两块文字中，需要把过去的不服气和如今的难受联系起来才能理解情绪变化。\",\n    \"下方单块长句包含较劲、力气耗尽、不服气消退、与那些人分开、只剩难受等多层意思。\",\n    \"中间三行较小文字连续堆叠，补充信息需要在多条之间筛选。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "42e74b33-5e76-4a77-9f21-77bb0fff4ba4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T012522030537Z", "elapsed_seconds": 36.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:25:58.930380+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "37b55e959458176d5ea0b8768b52b8bdbee099af5ac36a1de3a34d177585bcc1", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4